  "id": "affective-meaning",
  "term": "affective meaning",
  "definition": "Affective meaning is the emotional significance a person perceives in what they observe, such as movement. In this source, it refers to the valence and arousal qualities people infer from the spatiotemporal pattern of movement, even when other emotion cues are limited.",
